### Bundled runtime DLLs

The Windows GNU build ships `libstdc++-6.dll`, `libgcc_s_seh-1.dll` and
`libwinpthread-1.dll` from MinGW-w64. They are copied next to `fasttts.exe` by
`install-shortcut.ps1` so the app runs on a clean Windows install. libstdc++ is
GPLv3 with the GCC Runtime Library Exception; libgcc and winpthreads use the
GCC runtime exception / LGPL terms.

No Python code, model weights or third-party binaries are committed to the Rust
repository except those three small runtime DLLs. The ggml English model is
bundled locally in models/whisper.cpp/ggml-small.en.bin and excluded from Git
because of size.
